MAN(1)                      User Commands                     MAN(1)

NAME
    man - display MiniOS manual pages

SYNOPSIS
    man [-w] [section] name
    man -k keyword
    man -f name

DESCRIPTION
    man searches /usr/share/man by section and displays a page through pager
    when output is a terminal. MANPAGER, then PAGER, selects another pager.

OPTIONS
    -w   print the selected manual page path
    -k   search page names and one-line descriptions
    -f   print the one-line description for an exact page name

SECTIONS
    1 user commands, 2 system calls, 3 library interfaces, 4 special files,
    5 file formats, 7 conventions, and 8 administration commands.

